HST Office About dialog: "Privacy policy" link (vi: "Chính sách quyền riêng tư").

- aboutdialog.ui: a fourth link button btnPrivacy in the row of the website link (the
  Credits and Release Notes buttons stay hidden by hst-about.patch).
- about.cxx/about.hxx: the button opens
  https://office.hasontech.vn/quyen-rieng-tu/?utm_source=hst-office&utm_medium=about&utm_campaign=hst-office-1-0
  in the system browser, only when clicked; nothing is fetched by the office (UTM
  convention: docs/PRIVACY.md).
- vi cui/messages.po: the Vietnamese label.

License: modified upstream files keep their license (MPL-2.0).
Test: tests/unit/test_privacy_links.py, tests/runtime/check-privacy-links.py.
